WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Type I covers small appliances. Don't underestimate this section — it has tricky
questions.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
EPA 608 Type I practice exam covering small appliance definitions, recovery
requirements, self-contained and system-dependent equipment, leak repair
exemptions, and disposal requirements. 25 questions, must score 70 percent or

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Type I certification allows you to work on
small appliances legally.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Know the 5 lb cutoff. And — Know 90/80 percent recovery
requirements

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
What is the maximum charge that defines a small appliance under EPA 608? That
number is on the exam.

